<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>NutriFit - Kalori Hesaplayıcı</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 50px; background-color: #f4f9f4; color: #333; }
        .box { background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px; display: inline-block; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        select, button { padding: 10px; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 15px; border-radius: 5px; border: 1px solid #ccc; }
        button { background-color: #2E7D32; color: white; cursor: pointer; }
        button:hover { background-color: #1B5E20; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="box">
        <h2>🥗 NutriFit Kalori Hesaplayıcı</h2>
        <p>Yemeğinizi seçin, besin değerini görün:</p>
        <select id="yemek">
            <option value="Izgara Tavuk Salatası -> 350 Kalori (Protein: 35g)">Izgara Tavuk Salatası (350 kcal)</option>
            <option value="Mercimek Çorbası -> 180 Kalori (Protein: 9g)">Mercimek Çorbası (180 kcal)</option>
        </select>
        <br>
        <button onclick="hesapla()">Hesapla</button>
        <h3 id="sonuc" style="margin-top:20px; color:#2E7D32;"></h3>
    </div>
    <script>
        function hesapla() {
            var secim = document.getElementById("yemek").value;
            document.getElementById("sonuc").innerHTML = "Sonuç: " + secim;
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
